  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCMP in Kamuli, Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Church and Community Mobilization Process (CCMP) aims for all involved participants to explore and develop the ressources (diaconal assets) of the individual, the local church and the community. This 30 year old methodology will be used to empower members of Church of Uganda and pentecostal churches in wider Kamuli district in Uganda. Trainers from Tearfund will be responsible for training, while Agape our Mission will be responsible for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
